    <h1>Privacy Policy for Caracal</h1>

    <p class="date"><strong>Effective date:</strong> September 4, 2026</p>

    <p>
        Sahara Games ("we", "us", or "our") developed and published
        <strong>Caracal</strong>.
    </p>

    <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected and
        used when you use the Caracal mobile game.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

    <p>
        Caracal uses third-party advertising services, including
        Google Mobile Ads (AdMob). These services may automatically
        collect certain information from your device, including:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Approximate location</li>
        <li>Device or other identifiers, such as the advertising ID</li>
        <li>App interactions</li>
        <li>Diagnostic and performance information</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        This information may be collected or shared with third-party
        service providers for purposes including:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Advertising and marketing</li>
        <li>Analytics</li>
        <li>Fraud prevention, security, and compliance</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        Caracal does not require users to create an account and does not
        provide user account registration or login.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>

    <p>
        Caracal uses Google Mobile Ads (AdMob) to display advertisements.
    </p>

    <p>
        Google and its advertising partners may use information collected
        from your device to provide, measure, and improve advertising,
        as well as for fraud prevention and security purposes.
    </p>

    <p>
        For more information about how Google handles data, please review
        Google's Privacy Policy:
    </p>

    <p>
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">
            Google Privacy Policy
        </a>
    </p>

    <h2>Data Security</h2>

    <p>
        Information transmitted by the advertising services used by
        Caracal is encrypted in transit.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Deletion</h2>

    <p>
        Caracal does not provide user accounts or store personal user
        profiles on our own servers. Therefore, there is no user account
        or personal profile that can be deleted through Caracal.
    </p>

    <p>
        Third-party services used by the game may have their own data
        retention and deletion policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

    <p>
        Caracal is not specifically directed at children under the age
        of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information directly
        from children.
    </p>

    <p>
        If you believe that a child has provided personal information
        through the game, please contact us so that we can review
        the matter.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
        will be published on this page with an updated effective date.
    </p>

